+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later OR MIT
+/*
+ * Copyright 2024 Toradex
+ *
+ * Common dtsi for Verdin AM62 SoM on Ivy carrier board
+ *
+ * https://www.toradex.com/computer-on-modules/verdin-arm-family/ti-am62
