+
+	/* **********************Golden rxhigh search********************** */
+
+	/*
+	 *
+	 *		rx
+	 *	    127	^
+	 *		|
+	 *		|	|xxxx     ++++++++++++++++++++
+	 *		|	|xxxxx     +++++++++++++++++++
+	 *    search	|	|xxxxxx     ++++++++++++++++++
+	 *    rxhigh  --------->|xxxxxxx     +++++++++++++++++
+	 *    on fixed  |	|xxxxxxxx     ++++++++++++++++
+	 *    tx	|	|xxxxxxxxx     +++++++++++++++
+	 *		|	|xxxxxxxxxx     ++++++++++++++
+	 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxx     +++++++++++++
+	 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxxx     ++++++++++++
+	 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxxxx     +++++++++++
+	 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxxxxx     ++++++++++
+	 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx     +++++++++
+	 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx     ++++++++
