+	 */
+
+	/*
+	 *	|----------------------------------------------------------|
+	 *	| Primary | Secondary | Final                              |
+	 *	| Search  | Search    | Point                              |
+	 *	|---------|-----------|------------------------------------|
+	 *	| Fail    | Fail      | Return Fail                        |
+	 *	|---------|-----------|------------------------------------|
+	 *	| Fail    | Pass      | Choose Secondary                   |
+	 *	|---------|-----------|------------------------------------|
+	 *	| Pass    | Fail      | Choose Primary                     |
