+		 *	| Fail    | Fail      | Return Fail                   |
+		 *	|---------|-----------|-------------------------------|
+		 *	| Fail    | Pass      | Return Fail                   |
+		 *	|---------|-----------|-------------------------------|
+		 *	| Pass    | Fail      | Return Fail                   |
+		 *	|---------|-----------|-------------------------------|
