+		 *    tx	|	xxxxxxxxxx     ++++++++++++++|
+		 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxx     +++++++++++++|
+		 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxx     +++++++++++++
+		 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxxx     ++++++++++++
+		 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxxxx     +++++++++++
+		 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxxxxx     ++++++++++
+		 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx     +++++++++
+		 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx     ++++++++
+		 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx     +++++++
