+	 *		|	xxxxxx     +++++++++++++++++++
+	 *		|	xxxxxxx     ++++++++++++++++++
+	 *		|	xxxxxxxx     +++++++++++++++++
+	 *		|	xxxxxxxxx     ++++++++++++++++
+	 *		|	xxxxxxxxxx     +++++++++++++++
+	 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxx     ++++++++++++++
+	 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxx     +++++++++++++
