+	 *    rxhigh	|	xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx     +++++|+++
+	 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx     ++++|+++
+	 *	rxlow --------->xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx     +++|+++
