+		 *		|	xxxx|xxxxxx     ++++++++++++++
+		 *		|	xxxx|xxxxxxx     +++++++++++++
+		 *		|	xxxx|xxxxxxxx     ++++++++++++
+		 *		|	xxxx|xxxxxxxxx     +++++++++++
+		 *		|	xxxx|xxxxxxxxxx     ++++++++++
+		 *		|	xxxx|xxxxxxxxxxx     +++++++++
