+		 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxx     ++++++++|++++
+		 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxxx     +++++++|++++
+		 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxxxx     ++++++|++++
+		 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxxxxx     +++++|++++
+		 *		|	xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx     ++++|++++
