+
+# These configs enable Display drivers and add 600KB to the kernel Image.
+# Note that SK-AM62A does not support OLDI and has support for HDMI alone.
+# In an early display scenario for SK-AM62A, the following configs are not useful.
+CONFIG_DRM=y
